# Editor / OS cruft. The `**/` prefix matters: a bare `.DS_Store` only matches
# the one at the context root, so public/.DS_Store (or an editor dir nested
# anywhere) used to be copied into the image by `COPY . .` and served publicly
# at /.DS_Store.
